WEBVTT

00:04:59.913 --> 00:05:06.454
There are a lot of forms of armor that
can sometimes be rewarded at work.

00:05:06.871 --> 00:05:08.079
I think that's so true.

00:05:08.579 --> 00:05:13.204
I love your observation that that people
will use expertise or performance

00:05:13.204 --> 00:05:14.329
as armor at work.

00:05:14.579 --> 00:05:19.746
And it it really struck a chord with
me on a very deep level because

00:05:20.496 --> 00:05:24.454
I don't want to I don't want to
get to psychoanalytic here.

00:05:24.454 --> 00:05:28.121
But I you know, I had this this
defining experience, I guess,

00:05:28.121 --> 00:05:29.704
in many ways when I was 12,

00:05:29.704 --> 00:05:33.121
where all of my close friends dropped me
because I wasn't cool enough for them.